    },
    "The first preparation of this model takes about %lld minutes. It happens only once, and later ones take a few seconds." : {
      "comment" : "Preparation screen: names how long a first Core ML compile takes for models where it has been measured (issue #432). The argument is a number of minutes, always 2 or more.",
